  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Finely chop or crush garlic. <br>• In a medium saucepan, melt 1/2 the butter over medium heat. Cook 1/2 the garlic until fragrant, 1 min. Add basmati rice, the water (for the rice), stir, cover with a lid and <br>reduce heat to low. <br>• Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water has absorbed, 10 mins. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a5459ac748b7cf792505b17/step-1930c200.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, cut capsicum into bite-sized pieces. <br>• Thinly cut zucchini into half-moons. <br>• Drain and rinse black beans.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a5459ac748b7cf792505b17/step-87d13010.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook capsicum until softened, 4-5 mins. Add zucchini and black beans. Cook until tender, 2-3 mins. <br>• Stir in Tex-Mex spice blend, tomato paste, the brown sugar, remaining butter and garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a5459ac748b7cf792505b17/step-29cb9820.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Add the water (for the sauce) and stock powder. Reduce heat to low and simmer until slightly thickened, 3-4 mins. Season to taste. <br>• Divide rice between bowls and top with black bean chilli. Tear over coriander. Garnish with the chilli flakes (if using). <br>• Serve with sour cream (see ingredients).</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a5459ac748b7cf792505b17/step-94bcd830.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
